title: "GaussFlow"
abstract: "A deterministic Gaussian 16 automation layer for computational chemistry: structure preparation, controlled input generation, queued execution, scientific validation, Li+ binding/BSSE, redox analysis, F-site enumeration, and real-time result logging."
